  "A passkey for Olaplex was written into the key list without being derived, and returned an empty catalogue. Re-derived from the CDN: caPu1A7... The invented value is recorded here because an unexplained empty result is how it was caught, and a future reader needs to know the list was once wrong.",
  "Catalogue-wide recency was first attempted with an unfiltered reviews.json query, which Bazaarvoice answers with zero rows. Every brand read as EMPTY, including Toro, which demonstrably serves 10,270 reviews under a ProductId filter. The diagnostic was wrong, not the keys. Recency is now measured across the top six products."
 ],
